  unitName: Royal Guard Galahad (EU)
  unitId: 750226
  unitNumber: 7181
  description: 'A powerful customized photon bot that can supervise and synchronize
    several war spear squads. It belonged to the famous King of Avalon, but scribes
    lost its trace after the great betrayal. It was found years later by the successor
    and old friend of its creator. Once restored, it presented strange, almost human-like,
    signs of guilt and regret. Its complete restoration reveals the secret of its
    soul: the testament of its Master.'
  summonDesc: I will complete the mission my Master entrusted me with, dear friend...
  fusionDesc: This new summon data improves my soul.
